    "Once started, Noah progresses the exit automatically in the background, broadcasting and fee-bumping exit transactions and paying fees from your onchain balance. The fees shown are estimates and may change. Only the claim fee is deducted from the recovered value. Cancellation is possible only until the final exit transaction is broadcast.": {
      "comment": "Native-only copy; no RN translation. Intentionally English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once started, Noah progresses the exit automatically in the background, broadcasting and fee-bumping exit transactions and paying fees from your onchain balance. The fees shown are estimates and may change. Only the claim fee is deducted from the recovered value. Cancellation is possible only until the final exit transaction is broadcast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
